        {
          "kind": "Text",
          "text": "<p>Most of the sermons are in chronological order but divided into three themes. A straightforward reading through Isaiah would mean reading 66 chapters in fourteen weeks, about five chapters per week.</p>",
          "collapsed_title": ""
        },
        {
          "kind": "Text",
          "text": "<ul><li><em>Week of February 16:</em> Isaiah 1–5</li><li><em>Week of February 23:</em> Isaiah 6–10</li><li><em>Week of March 2:</em> Isaiah 11–15</li><li><em>Week of March 9:</em> Isaiah 16–20</li><li><em>Week of March 16:</em> Isaiah 21–25</li><li><em>Week of March 23:</em> Isaiah 26–30</li><li><em>Week of March 30:</em> Isaiah 31–35</li><li><em>Week of April 6:</em> Isaiah 36–40</li><li><em>Week of April 13:</em> Isaiah 41–45</li><li><em>Week of April 20:</em> Isaiah 46–50</li><li><em>Week of April 27:</em> Isaiah 51–55</li><li><em>Week of May 4:</em> Isaiah 56–60</li><li><em>Week of May 11:</em> Isaiah 61–63</li><li><em>Week of May 18:</em> Isaiah 64–66</li></ul>",
          "collapsed_title": ""
        }
